Oh, sorry. I see that now.

What you do is subset the "gene" component is the cross object.
Here I invert the order of the first 4 chromosomes in the hyper data.

  data(hyper)
  hyper$geno <- hyper$geno[c(4,3,2,1,5:19, "X")]

So you might do:

  mycross$geno <- mycross$geno[as.character(1:9)]

karl

